# Get started with {{ display_name }}

This tutorial walks you through deploying {{ display_name }} and verifying
that it is running correctly.

## Prerequisites

- A Juju controller bootstrapped and ready
- A Juju model created (`juju add-model {{ charm_name }}`)

## Deploy the charm

```bash
juju deploy {{ charm_name }}
```

Wait for the deployment to settle:

```bash
juju wait-for application {{ charm_name }} --query='status.current=="active"'
```

## Verify the deployment

Check that the application is active and idle:

```bash
juju status
```
